   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "at-least-once -> idempotent consume",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t375075502",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 700.0,
   "y": 22,
   "width": 467.50000000000006,
   "height": 21.25,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1d1d1d",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1962260773,
   "versionNonce": 894853642,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "the dual-write hazard vs. the transactional outbox",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 17
  },
  {
   "id": "t721076482",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 262,
   "width": 986.1500000000001,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1983591747,
   "versionNonce": 1126615963,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not: nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "A crash, a client timeout, or a pod reschedule in the gap between the two writes leaves one system updated and the other not: nothing is watching for the mismatch.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t905098194",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 278,
   "width": 1028.5,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1313366634,
   "versionNonce": 1568645422,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reversing the order (publish, then save) relocates the same gap; it does not close it. No sequencing of two independent writes to two independent systems closes this gap.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t825221503",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 745,
   "width": 919.6,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 536694351,
   "versionNonce": 94225423,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate: but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not buried in application code.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The second hop (table to broker) is still separate: but now explicit, bounded, and owned by one piece of infrastructure, not buried in application code.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
  {
   "id": "t1900370575",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 761,
   "width": 901.45,
   "height": 13.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#555555",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 830615312,
   "versionNonce": 1836647701,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "At-least-once delivery out of the relay is only safe because the consumer on the far side is idempotent (check-then-insert, deduped by aggregate id).",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "baseline": 11
  },
